ley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792369696890000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3S9h66z2jT45cxkZgCxATW\">https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility</a><br>\r\n                 <br>\r\n                To post: email <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\n                To unsubscribe: email <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggplot2+u...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\n                More options: <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792369696890000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1vwovanB4PQQA26CPNJoEq\">http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2</a><br>\r\n                <br>\r\n                --- <br>\r\n                You received this message because you are subscribed to\r\n                the Google Groups &quot;ggplot2&quot; group.<br>\r\n                To unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails\r\n                from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggplot2+u...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\n                For more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792369696890000&amp;usg=AOvVaw07lnisN5PlrcFjQoIR6Ie7\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<br>\r\n              </font></span></blockquote>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <br>\r\n        <br clear=\"all\">\r\n        <div><br>\r\n        </div>\r\n        -- <br>\r\n        <div class=\"gmail_signature\">In God we trust, all others bring\r\n          data.</div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      -- <br>\r\n      -- <br>\r\n      You received this message because you are subscribed to the\r\n      ggplot2 mailing list.<br>\r\n      Please provide a reproducible example: <a href=\"https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792369696890000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3S9h66z2jT45cxkZgCxATW\">https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility</a><br>\r\n       <br>\r\n      To post: email <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\n      To unsubscribe: email <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggplot2+u...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\n      More options: <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792369696890000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1vwovanB4PQQA26CPNJoEq\">http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2</a><br>\r\n      <br>\r\n      --- <br></blockquote></div>"
